<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Reliance Steel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Reliance Steel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Anthony Carpet initiated coverage of Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum Co with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.80 per share for 1996, and $3.05 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 35-1/4.</p>
</text>
